[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3906783230","pull_request_review_id":5081212439,"id":3906783230,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc7o3Mf-","diff_hunk":"","path":"core/crypto/hashing_context.cpp","commit_id":"9a4169f1ef2c808039694d3ac47877eed7ba811b","original_commit_id":"9a4169f1ef2c808039694d3ac47877eed7ba811b","user":{"login":"NoNormalDev","id":190293561,"node_id":"U_kgDOC1emOQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190293561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev","html_url":"https://github.com/NoNormalDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Wouldn't it be better to remove the variable `r` and use `p_chunk.ptr()` directly instead, similar to what you've done in `FileAccess`? I mean we're still duplicating the code three times in both situations, so why not remove the variable?\r\n\r\nAlso IMO this makes the code's functionality clearer, since `r` is a non-descriptive variable name.\r\n\r\nOf course this is just a nitpick, you can choose not to do this, but decided to comment about this based on the nature of this PR.\r\n\r\nEDIT: Talking about this chunk of code, I don't know why github is acting weird:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nError HashingContext::update(const PackedByteArray &p_chunk) {\r\n\tERR_FAIL_NULL_V(ctx, ERR_UNCONFIGURED);\r\n\tsize_t len = p_chunk.size();\r\n\tERR_FAIL_COND_V(len == 0, FAILED);\r\n\tconst uint8_t *r = p_chunk.ptr();\r\n\tswitch (type) {\r\n\t\tcase HASH_MD5:\r\n\t\t\treturn ((CryptoCore::MD5Context *)ctx)->update(r, len);\r\n\t\tcase HASH_SHA1:\r\n\t\t\treturn ((CryptoCore::SHA1Context *)ctx)->update(r, len);\r\n\t\tcase HASH_SHA256:\r\n\t\t\treturn ((CryptoCore::SHA256Context *)ctx)->update(r, len);\r\n\t}\r\n\treturn ERR_UNAVAILABLE;\r\n```","created_at":"2026-09-01T17:43:56Z","updated_at":"2026-09-01T17:45:07Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123077#discussion_r3906783230","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123077","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3906783230"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123077#discussion_r3906783230"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123077"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3906783230/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":34,"original_line":34,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":1,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3906877361","pull_request_review_id":5081319619,"id":3906877361,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc7o3jex","diff_hunk":"","path":"core/crypto/hashing_context.cpp","commit_id":"9a4169f1ef2c808039694d3ac47877eed7ba811b","original_commit_id":"9a4169f1ef2c808039694d3ac47877eed7ba811b","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://